+// Every course entrance is gated by that course's own unlock (its painting/
+// key item) *in addition* to whatever gets it checked below (castle key,
+// etc). Bowser levels (BITDW/BITFS/BITS), BBH (SM64AP_HaveBBH()), BITFS
